WEBVTT

00:11.545 --> 00:15.174
Hanaukyo Maid Team

00:15.549 --> 00:21.510
Open a window in the morning.

00:21.588 --> 00:28.152
Flowers of light
surround the world.

00:29.196 --> 00:35.101
As if the hidden
feeling in my heart...

00:35.168 --> 00:42.131
...is melting away now.

00:43.176 --> 00:48.113
I'm holding
the fragrance of the season.

00:49.549 --> 00:55.784
I wish for you...

00:55.856 --> 00:58.791
I wanted to meet you...

00:58.859 --> 01:02.556
...ever since the day I was born.

01:02.629 --> 01:05.462
Only you...

01:05.532 --> 01:09.969
...I want to protect only you.

01:10.036 --> 01:12.300
Just you...

01:12.372 --> 01:14.306
...I want to touch.

01:15.709 --> 01:20.840
My hand holding yours.

01:22.482 --> 01:24.279
I want to deliver.

01:25.886 --> 01:27.877
Voice of my heart.

01:32.526 --> 01:35.324
Towards 2 o'clock.
We're almost there.

01:35.395 --> 01:36.259
Roger.

01:37.164 --> 01:38.825
We're finally here...

01:41.868 --> 01:43.460
Everyone...

01:43.537 --> 01:44.936
Just promise one thing.

01:46.339 --> 01:47.806
No matter what happens...

01:47.874 --> 01:49.842
...we'll all go back together.

01:50.744 --> 01:51.938
All right?

01:52.546 --> 01:53.535
All right.

01:53.613 --> 01:55.843
What are you talking
like a big shot for?

01:56.583 --> 01:58.175
Ryuka-san...

01:58.251 --> 02:00.549
When did you get in...

02:00.620 --> 02:04.215
Battling the Hanaukyo family
is the Jihioh family's lifework.

02:04.291 --> 02:07.260
So come with me.

02:07.327 --> 02:09.022
We'll go storm in for a fight!

02:14.000 --> 02:18.903
Forced Entry

02:32.352 --> 02:34.183
S-Shikoh-In-sama.

02:35.055 --> 02:36.317
They have come?

02:42.162 --> 02:44.255
Who did this?

02:44.331 --> 02:45.355
You did!

02:45.432 --> 02:48.492
Heat source
detected at 12 o'clock...

02:48.568 --> 02:49.967
It's a missile!

02:50.036 --> 02:51.003
What?

02:56.142 --> 02:58.576
No good, it won't hold up!

02:58.645 --> 03:01.307
Never mind!
Plunge in as we are!

03:01.381 --> 03:02.780
What now?
What now? What now?
Roger!

03:16.563 --> 03:17.552
Are you okay?

03:17.631 --> 03:18.962
Yes, somehow...

03:19.032 --> 03:19.999
There they are!

03:20.066 --> 03:24.662
Not even the Hanaukyo family
head can enter this holy place!

03:24.738 --> 03:28.970
We can't let anyone pass without
Hokusai-sama's permission!

03:30.243 --> 03:31.801
If we cannot pass...

03:33.513 --> 03:34.878
...we must enter by force.

03:41.488 --> 03:42.614
Taro-sama, now!

03:50.163 --> 03:53.428
Konoe Tsurugi's alleged godlike
speed at drawing swords...

03:53.500 --> 03:57.231
How could she cut this
many helmets in one flash...?

04:00.507 --> 04:01.906
You're amazing, Konoe-san.

04:02.509 --> 04:04.067
I just did my job.

04:04.844 --> 04:06.641
What's with her?

04:06.713 --> 04:09.477
She made only herself look good.

04:09.549 --> 04:12.143
The leader's not
making herself look good.

04:12.218 --> 04:13.981
She looked good from the start.

04:15.355 --> 04:16.845
I can do that, too...

04:24.130 --> 04:26.496
W-What are we going to do?

04:26.566 --> 04:28.659
Please leave it to me.

04:28.735 --> 04:30.032
This is Decoy-kun.

04:30.837 --> 04:33.328
When you stick it on like this...

04:33.406 --> 04:34.498
Here.

04:36.242 --> 04:39.643
The sensors respond
and target only that seal.

04:40.647 --> 04:42.842
Now let's go!

04:42.916 --> 04:44.543
Hey! You! Ow!

04:45.585 --> 04:46.813
Hot!

04:47.654 --> 04:50.054
Taro Hanaukyo and 5 others...

04:50.123 --> 04:52.591
...have entered the third
block and are moving in.

04:52.659 --> 04:54.126
I see.

04:54.194 --> 04:57.288
Take good care of Mariel.

04:58.131 --> 04:59.496
Please leave it to me.

04:59.566 --> 05:03.263
Yes, Red King Flag's
number one power...

05:03.336 --> 05:04.667
...I'm counting on you.

05:15.148 --> 05:18.276
Whoa...

05:23.456 --> 05:25.219
Oh, you're still here?

05:25.291 --> 05:26.315
You...

05:27.961 --> 05:28.928
This place is...

05:28.995 --> 05:30.986
Our first target.

05:40.373 --> 05:41.362
Bingo.

05:44.911 --> 05:45.900
Get in.

05:45.979 --> 05:47.412
Mariel is below.

05:54.621 --> 05:55.610
It's up to you.

05:57.824 --> 05:59.485
We'll stay here.

06:00.126 --> 06:02.594
Make sure you bring
Mariel back with you.

06:02.662 --> 06:03.629
But...

06:04.464 --> 06:05.396
Taro-sama...

06:10.804 --> 06:12.135
Honestly.

06:12.205 --> 06:14.730
You're too nice.

06:14.808 --> 06:17.902
Putting your lives
on the line for that midget...

06:17.977 --> 06:20.207
Look who's talking.

06:20.280 --> 06:22.748
You followed us
to a place like this.

06:23.750 --> 06:25.308
I...

06:25.385 --> 06:27.376
...just stormed in for a fight...

06:27.454 --> 06:30.252
She's a bad liar, isn't she?

06:30.323 --> 06:31.221
Shut up!

06:34.828 --> 06:37.160
I just...

06:37.230 --> 06:38.424
...would be troubled.

06:38.498 --> 06:40.159
Without those two...

06:44.170 --> 06:45.398
Here they come.

06:45.472 --> 06:47.838
This elevator is
the only access route in.

06:47.907 --> 06:50.637
No matter what happens,
we'll protect it.

06:59.753 --> 07:00.981
Taro-sama.

07:01.054 --> 07:05.889
I talked big and said that
I was going to take Mariel back.

07:05.959 --> 07:10.953
But I'm always being saved by
you, Grace, and everyone else.

07:12.932 --> 07:14.695
That isn't true.

07:15.235 --> 07:16.327
But...

07:16.402 --> 07:17.664
Taro-sama.

07:17.737 --> 07:20.968
Everyone has his or her own role.

07:22.475 --> 07:23.499
That's...

07:23.576 --> 07:27.910
This is the present that
you gave all the maids before.

07:33.987 --> 07:37.582
You are the center
of all the maids' hearts.

07:39.459 --> 07:44.328
We are able to do our best
without fearing anything...

07:44.397 --> 07:49.300
...because you're doing your job
to stand at the center of us all.

07:50.170 --> 07:51.762
Konoe-san...

07:51.838 --> 07:53.465
We're about to arrive.

07:57.811 --> 08:00.939
Mariel is beyond here...

08:01.014 --> 08:02.208
Let's go.

08:07.253 --> 08:08.220
What's wrong?

08:10.757 --> 08:11.724
What?

08:20.934 --> 08:23.596
Shikoh-In-ne-hsama...

08:23.670 --> 08:26.867
Retrieving Mariel is
the previous head's will.

08:26.940 --> 08:30.103
In the name of Hokusai
Hanaukyo's bodyguards...

08:30.176 --> 08:32.610
...and hunting soldiers,
the Red King Flag...

08:32.679 --> 08:35.079
...I will not allow
you to intrude further.

08:35.148 --> 08:36.410
But...

08:37.917 --> 08:39.248
What do I do?

08:39.319 --> 08:42.288
It's impossible for me
to stop her as I am now.

08:42.856 --> 08:44.790
Retreat quietly.

08:44.858 --> 08:46.382
And we'll lower our swords.

08:48.094 --> 08:49.561
The leader's awed...

08:52.832 --> 08:53.799
Leader...

08:55.969 --> 08:57.027
Leader...

08:57.670 --> 08:59.729
I'll take care of her!

09:01.007 --> 09:01.974
Yashima!

09:21.227 --> 09:22.194
It's futile.

09:22.262 --> 09:23.354
Shut up.

09:23.429 --> 09:25.829
The only one who can defeat me...

09:25.899 --> 09:28.299
...is the leader!

09:33.406 --> 09:34.668
Sanae-chan...

09:34.741 --> 09:38.302
There's no one
stronger than the leader!

09:39.345 --> 09:42.837
Because she's the best
leader in the world!

09:42.916 --> 09:44.508
Yashima...

09:50.123 --> 09:53.183
Taro-sama,
leave this to me. Hurry!

09:53.259 --> 09:54.317
B-But...

09:54.394 --> 09:55.793
Go to Mariel-sama...

10:09.742 --> 10:10.709
Yashima!

10:12.312 --> 10:14.473
What a brave girl.

10:15.214 --> 10:16.738
Let me hear your name.

10:16.816 --> 10:19.182
Sanae is my last name...

10:19.886 --> 10:21.683
Yashima is my first name!

10:32.532 --> 10:33.521
Yashima!

10:34.233 --> 10:35.200
Yashima!

10:38.371 --> 10:39.338
Yashima!

10:41.708 --> 10:42.834
Leader...

10:43.910 --> 10:46.777
That one...

10:46.846 --> 10:50.714
...is nothing.

10:51.751 --> 10:55.448
You can win...

10:56.255 --> 11:00.089
You can win easily...

11:02.228 --> 11:03.422
Yes.

11:03.496 --> 11:05.726
Watch me fight from here.

11:14.807 --> 11:16.468
Your eyes look good.

11:16.542 --> 11:18.806
I guess you met a good master.

11:18.878 --> 11:20.812
Not only a master.

11:21.647 --> 11:25.344
I met a wonderful staff whom
I couldn't meet under you.

11:25.418 --> 11:27.443
No, colleagues.

11:27.520 --> 11:30.114
They helped me grow.

11:31.491 --> 11:33.391
Come, my younger sister.

11:41.834 --> 11:42.926
Here...

11:47.540 --> 11:52.375
Hanaukyo Maid Team

11:56.582 --> 11:57.810
Mariel!

11:57.884 --> 11:58.873
Mariel...

12:02.321 --> 12:03.345
Mariel...

12:07.293 --> 12:10.626
What is that dirty accessory?

12:11.731 --> 12:12.857
Huh?

12:12.932 --> 12:15.400
You didn't get one, Ryuka-san?

12:15.468 --> 12:18.232
This is a present from Taro-sama.

12:19.105 --> 12:20.072
Taro?

12:21.174 --> 12:22.607
You're jealous.

12:22.675 --> 12:23.437
Here, here.

12:23.509 --> 12:27.343
W-Who'd want such ugly stuff?

12:27.413 --> 12:28.380
Ow.

12:30.583 --> 12:32.380
I'll lend it to you.

12:32.452 --> 12:33.544
It's special.

12:33.619 --> 12:37.350
So let's keep the promise
we made with Taro-sama.

12:40.059 --> 12:41.458
To hell with the promise.

12:41.994 --> 12:45.794
I just want to destroy
the Hanaukyo family.

12:45.865 --> 12:48.060
You're really stubborn...

12:48.134 --> 12:50.125
Shut up.

12:50.203 --> 12:51.363
Here they come.

12:54.107 --> 12:55.438
Cynthia?

12:55.508 --> 12:56.770
What?

12:56.843 --> 12:59.004
We can't stay here?

12:59.078 --> 13:00.045
Go down?

13:28.941 --> 13:30.772
I'm happy.

13:30.843 --> 13:34.802
Because a former crybaby like
you doesn't mind even death.

13:35.882 --> 13:38.908
But determination alone
cannot defeat me.

13:54.767 --> 13:56.928
I won't let you go...

13:57.003 --> 13:59.733
I promised my master.

14:02.608 --> 14:03.575
All right.

14:04.944 --> 14:06.343
Then die here.

14:08.981 --> 14:11.916
Yashima, take care of the rest.

14:22.628 --> 14:24.255
Go!

14:36.776 --> 14:38.073
Superb.

14:39.178 --> 14:40.145
But...

14:43.816 --> 14:45.647
Mariel! Mariel!

14:46.452 --> 14:47.646
Can you hear me?

14:47.720 --> 14:48.687
It's me!

14:48.754 --> 14:50.153
Mariel!

15:04.904 --> 15:06.030
Damn it!

15:26.058 --> 15:26.922
Mariel!

15:27.627 --> 15:29.458
Wake up, Mariel!

15:29.528 --> 15:31.621
Answer me.

15:31.697 --> 15:32.664
Please!

15:43.242 --> 15:44.231
Konoe-san!

15:45.711 --> 15:47.679
Please concede.

15:47.747 --> 15:50.875
Mariel has closed
her mind completely.

15:50.950 --> 15:53.316
She will not awaken
no matter what you do.

15:54.086 --> 15:56.020
Leave Mariel and return home.

15:56.088 --> 15:57.055
I refuse.

15:59.158 --> 16:02.753
I promised everyone at the mansion.

16:03.462 --> 16:05.191
That I'd bring Mariel back...

16:05.264 --> 16:07.095
That we'd all return safely...

16:07.166 --> 16:11.569
I won't let you treat Mariel
like a toy any longer.

16:11.637 --> 16:12.661
I...

16:14.507 --> 16:19.410
The previous head said to punish
you when you showed defiance.

16:21.380 --> 16:22.938
You've forgotten.

16:23.015 --> 16:27.213
That Mariel became
this way because of you.

16:33.492 --> 16:34.652
Mariel...

16:36.696 --> 16:39.130
If you want to rescue her,
try moving.

16:40.733 --> 16:44.100
No matter how much you
scream or how much you think...

16:44.170 --> 16:46.695
...Mariel will not open her mind.

16:46.772 --> 16:51.869
There is no other way but
for us to repair and adjust her.

16:51.944 --> 16:54.936
Don't talk as if
Mariel were an object...

16:55.014 --> 16:57.005
You still don't understand?

16:57.083 --> 16:58.448
I don't understand.

16:58.517 --> 17:03.614
Mariel may certainly have
collapsed because of me.

17:03.689 --> 17:08.217
She may have closed her mind
because I demanded her feelings.

17:09.328 --> 17:11.421
But I like Mariel.

17:12.064 --> 17:15.898
I want to talk to the true Mariel
and know her various feelings.

17:17.570 --> 17:21.131
I won't let anyone tell me
that feeling is wrong!

17:21.941 --> 17:27.846
It's wrong for you to treat her like
an object and control her mind!

17:27.913 --> 17:30.905
Then use your full
strength to take her back.

17:31.584 --> 17:32.642
Taro-sama!

17:35.621 --> 17:36.588
Damn.

17:38.391 --> 17:39.653
Mariel...

17:41.026 --> 17:43.620
You asked what my
desire was, didn't you?

17:45.331 --> 17:49.995
My desire is for you
to live peacefully.

17:50.069 --> 17:51.127
And someday...

17:52.538 --> 17:53.630
Someday...

17:55.141 --> 17:56.438
Someday...

17:56.509 --> 17:59.410
...to show me your true smile.

18:02.782 --> 18:05.808
That's my desire.

18:06.519 --> 18:07.816
Taro-sama...

18:10.589 --> 18:11.647
Taro-sama...

18:13.793 --> 18:14.760
Mariel?

18:16.929 --> 18:17.987
Taro-sama...

18:18.864 --> 18:19.956
Taro-sama...

18:20.633 --> 18:21.759
Taro-sama!

18:22.768 --> 18:23.735
Mariel...

18:24.537 --> 18:25.299
Mariel!

18:34.680 --> 18:35.806
Mariel...

18:37.149 --> 18:39.879
That's impossible...

18:44.256 --> 18:45.416
Taro-sama!

18:45.491 --> 18:47.015
Hold it.

18:47.092 --> 18:48.889
Don't move.

18:59.839 --> 19:01.067
Hurry!

19:03.642 --> 19:05.507
Go straight up in this...

19:05.578 --> 19:06.545
That's...

19:08.647 --> 19:10.615
This is ridiculous...

19:10.683 --> 19:11.581
Faster!

19:11.650 --> 19:13.550
There's no way I can!

19:15.654 --> 19:17.212
No good...

19:17.289 --> 19:18.313
She'll catch up.

19:25.931 --> 19:27.091
What on earth?

19:27.166 --> 19:30.567
You made it in time, Jungfrau!

19:38.844 --> 19:40.243
It's not good...

19:40.312 --> 19:42.109
She's heading this way...

19:45.484 --> 19:47.452
This is bad.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.112
Can't we do something?

19:53.926 --> 19:54.893
Is this it?

19:57.429 --> 19:59.420
Farewell, my...

20:05.237 --> 20:06.636
Fire!

20:14.013 --> 20:15.446
Elder Sister...

20:15.514 --> 20:18.142
A-Are we saved?

20:19.285 --> 20:21.879
Good, almost at the roof.

20:24.990 --> 20:26.924
Konoe-san,
are your injuries serious?

20:28.327 --> 20:29.794
No...

20:29.862 --> 20:31.659
I'm sorry.

20:32.598 --> 20:34.395
I lacked the strength.

20:35.467 --> 20:38.402
Me too.
Sorry for overworking you.

20:43.542 --> 20:46.010
This was what
you wanted, wasn't it?

20:46.078 --> 20:47.067
Yes.

20:47.146 --> 20:48.773
Good work.

20:48.847 --> 20:51.645
Everything has just started.

20:51.717 --> 20:56.416
Mariel and Taro can
deepen their bonds now.

21:02.394 --> 21:04.794
Look! That's them!

21:05.798 --> 21:07.527
Let's go, everyone!

21:08.300 --> 21:09.528
Here we go...

21:10.135 --> 21:15.573
Welcome home!

21:16.709 --> 21:18.472
Everyone...

21:18.544 --> 21:19.977
Taro-sama.

21:26.318 --> 21:27.945
Taro-sama?

21:28.020 --> 21:30.284
You don't need to worry.

21:30.356 --> 21:31.721
It's all over.

21:33.659 --> 21:34.751
Let's return.

21:34.827 --> 21:36.226
To our home.

21:38.230 --> 21:39.424
Yes.

21:45.771 --> 21:49.104
Please leave everything to us.

21:49.174 --> 21:51.267
Hanaukyo Maid Team.

21:52.378 --> 21:55.506
We're going to take care of you.

21:55.581 --> 21:58.675
Your private personal team.

21:58.751 --> 22:01.845
Always to match your taste.

22:01.920 --> 22:04.150
We're highly motivated.

22:05.190 --> 22:08.353
We polish our minds and bodies.

22:08.427 --> 22:11.362
Tell us anything.

22:11.430 --> 22:23.001
Just want you to be
pleased, to be pleased.

22:24.076 --> 22:34.680
But, but,
what a cold-hearted man.

22:36.955 --> 22:43.053
Look, the stars are beautiful.

22:43.128 --> 22:48.725
Tomorrow sure
will be sunny, too.

22:49.768 --> 22:56.071
Tonight too, in your dream too...

22:56.141 --> 23:00.441
...we serve you.

23:09.988 --> 23:12.320
Peaceful sunshine
and floating clouds.

23:12.391 --> 23:15.918
In an unchanged time,
I realized something.

23:15.994 --> 23:18.929
Episode 12, True Smile.

23:18.997 --> 23:20.499
You see, right now, I am so...

23:20.499 --> 23:22.234
Next Episode
True Smile
You see, right now, I am so...

23:22.234 --> 23:24.395
Next Episode
True Smile
